{
    "article_summary": "The article describes a mild, photoredox-catalyzed direct C-H sulfonylation of aniline derivatives using bench-stable sulfinate salts. The reaction is mediated by visible light using iridium or acridinium photocatalysts and potassium persulfate as an oxidant, enabling late-stage functionalization of complex drug molecules like linezolid and promethazine.",
